          },
          "help": "z-lab DFlash2 draft, block 8, V2 model runner, warmups off. Upstream claims 67.1 / 121.5 / 211.5 / 279.2 aggregate tok/s at c1 / c2 / c4 / c6 and NIAH 3/3 at 262,144.",
          "label": "DFlash2 K=8",
          "value": "dflash2"
        }
      ],
      "help": "Which draft mechanism serves the target. Upstream: MTP is the best at c8 and above; DFlash2 is the best at c1 to c6 and for full-262K needle retrieval, and needs the overlay in this image plus the 3.6 GB z-lab draft.",
